00:24:56.460 --> 00:25:00.920
<v Maya>The attackers piggybacked on the part of the script that hosts customer code,

457
00:25:00.920 --> 00:25:07.020
<v Maya>injecting their own payload before it was signed and sent from cdn.optimizely.com.

458
00:25:07.810 --> 00:25:09.240
<v Alex>So the script was already signed?

459
00:25:09.680 --> 00:25:13.250
<v Maya>Yes, a valid certificate for that domain still signed it,

